WEBVTT

00:00:00.619 --> 00:00:05.380
⟨-ODNYA⟩ VTOROE NOYABRYA TYSYACHA DEVYAT'SOT DEVYANOSTO SED'MOGO GODA. MY BERЁМ INTERV'YU

00:00:05.412 --> 00:00:06.924
U FEL'DMAN BRUKHI.

00:00:07.504 --> 00:00:12.088
INTERV'YU BERЁT LEONID SAPOZHNIKOV. MY NAKHODIMSYA V GORODE BERSHAD' V UKRAINE.

00:00:12.499 --> 00:00:16.526
YAZYK INTERV'YU: IDISH I RUSSKIY. KASSETA NOMER TRI.

00:00:19.873 --> 00:00:22.837
BRUNYA, VOT KAK VY SCHITAETE,

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.841
 KONECHNO ETO BYLO DETSTVO VASHE,

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.394
VREMYA GETTO,

00:00:27.535 --> 00:00:34.520
NO ONO SYGRALO KAKUYU-TO ROL'⟨, V,⟩ OTRITSATEL'NUYU V VASHEY DAL'NEYSHEY ZHIZNI?

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:39.510
VED' GODY GETTO POLOMALI, ZHIZN' SEM'I: OTETS POGIB.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:44.842
ESLI BY NE BYLO VOYNY, ESLI BY KAK-TO PO-DRUGOMU SLOZHILAS' ISTORIYA, MOGLO BYT' PO-DRUGOMU U VAS?

00:00:42.688 --> 00:00:43.829
ven...

00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:46.187
nu, KONECHNO.

00:00:46.187 --> 00:00:48.285
ven ⟨s'zol nit⟩ geven zayn milkhome,

00:00:48.358 --> 00:00:52.165
volt der foter geven in der heym, volt geven a gut lebn bay mir,

00:00:52.257 --> 00:00:55.840
un ikh volt geVYRASTAet mit a foter.

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:58.900
azoy hob ikh ge- geVYRASTAet on a foter.

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:01.010
un, vos zhe kh'bin geven alt dray yor,

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:04.401
hob ikh ZAPOMNet az er hot gezogt, ikh zol nit loyfn ibern veg,

00:01:04.525 --> 00:01:08.260
vayl ikh bin geven a kleyne, kh'hob gehat lib tsu loyfn. ikh bin geven a SHUSTRe.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.700
hot er gezogt der mamen, "kuk tsun ir, vayl zi vet nokh umfaln oykhet."

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:14.680
iz ven s'⟨zol nit⟩ geven zayn di milkhome, volt geven geven a gut lebn.

00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:16.460
ven s'⟨zol nit⟩ geven zayn di geto,

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:19.329
⟨vos s'iz geven⟩ zikh NUZHDAen oyf di mentshn, oyf di,

00:01:19.329 --> 00:01:21.020
volt geven a gute ZHIZN'.

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:26.979
un azoy hob ikh nit gehat keyn lebn nit. es iz geven a ZHIZN', s'iz tsebrokhn gevorn dos lebn gevorn bay mayn mamen un bay mir, un VSЁ.

00:01:27.711 --> 00:01:29.290
SKAZHITE, VASHA MAMA,

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:34.450
 KOGDA-NIBUD' VSPOMINALA ZHIZN' S OTSOM? VOT, KAK UNK...

00:01:33.162 --> 00:01:37.546
yo. KONECHNO. zi fleg mir dertseyln, zi hot VSPOMINAet,

00:01:37.546 --> 00:01:39.301
"er iz gegangen tsu der arbet."

00:01:39.301 --> 00:01:43.450
un zi fleg mir dertseyln, "ikh hob gehat a gut lebn bay dayn, papen.

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:48.230
er fleg mikh keyn mol nit OBIDen, er fleg mikh nit, OBZYVAen, er fleg mikh nit shlogn,

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:49.670
er fleg nit trinken."

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:52.007
kh'hob gehat a... "host gehat a goldenem pape."

00:01:52.007 --> 00:01:54.510
un DAZHE mayn pape's shvester,

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.920
un di briders, hobn oykh gezogt az Moyshe

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:58.240
iz geven der shtiler:

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:02.048
"Moyshe shtrikl-dreyer iz geven shtark a shti- a guter, yunger-man,"

00:02:02.048 --> 00:02:05.710
un VSЁ. mayn pape iz avekgegangen oyf der milkhome VMESTE mit,

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:09.150
mit mayn feter Khaim, mit, Sashe's foter.

00:02:09.324 --> 00:02:12.005
hot er im gezogt, "Moyshe, kum antloyfn."

00:02:12.005 --> 00:02:16.840
hot mayn pape gezogt... er iz geven ⟨UNK⟩⟨BOYUS'⟩, hot er gezogt, "vos zhe ikh'l geyn antloyfn? m'vet mikh pakn,

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:17.970
vet men mikh hargen."

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:21.760
iz er antloyf- antlofn. er iz geblibn lebn, der feter Khaim,

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:24.730
un mayn pape iz dortn geharget. VSЁ.

00:02:26.807 --> 00:02:34.290
VY KOGDA-NIBUD' INTERESOVALIS', VOT, PYTALIS' UZNAT', GDE IMENNO POGIB VASH OTETS?

00:02:34.165 --> 00:02:36.403
nu, az ikh bin gegangen in VOENKOMAT

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:37.764
un ikh hob gefregt,

00:02:37.764 --> 00:02:39.030
hobn zey gezogt,

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:40.760
"mir veysn aleyn nit vu.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:45.026
se shraybt zikh in der IZVESHCHENIE, CHTO PROPAVSHIY BEZ IZVESTIY."

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:46.930
 nu, ver zhe veys dortn?

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:49.970
tsi er iz in, in di yarn aropgefaln,

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:54.760
tsi m'hot im geharget, I VSЁ. s'iz dokh geven a sakh, Z-, erd.

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:57.660
UNK farshit gevorn un VSЁ. m'hot nit gekent gefinen di mentshn.

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:00.500
m'hot nit gekent gefinen, ⟨tsi s'-⟩ tsi s'iz Moyshe Feldman,

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.356
tsi s'iz dortn a anderer.

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:04.652
azoy hobn zey mir geentfert.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.596
V- MOZHNO SKAZAT', CHTO

00:03:12.083 --> 00:03:14.982
VY KAK BY, VASHA SEM'YA KAK BY PROZHILA

00:03:14.982 --> 00:03:16.391
DVE ZHIZNI:

00:03:16.391 --> 00:03:19.151
ODNU MALEN'KUYU, KOGDA BYL OTETS,

00:03:17.736 --> 00:03:19.772
⟨ODNU... un a⟩ groyse.

00:03:19.151 --> 00:03:27.197
KOGDA BYL OTETS, I ODNU BOL'SHUYU, KOTORAYA NACHALAS' S VOYNOY I, MOZHNO SKAZAT', PRODOLZHAETSYA PO SEGODNYASHNIY DEN', ETA ZHIZN'.

00:03:20.368 --> 00:03:22.252
UNK BOL'SHUYU.

00:03:22.343 --> 00:03:23.450
VOYNOY.

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:27.719
⟨DA,⟩ biz hayntikn tog, DA.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:34.908
POTOMU CHTO, V- KAK VY SCHITAETE, ESLI BYL BY OTETS, VY BY OKONCHILI SHKOLU UNK ⟨SREDNYUYU...⟩?

00:03:27.777 --> 00:03:28.817
ZHIZN'.

00:03:33.683 --> 00:03:36.877
KONECHNO, ven ikh, geven zayn mayn foter,

00:03:36.877 --> 00:03:42.117
volt ikh geven gekontshet di shkole, volt ikh geven efsher geven a gramotne, bin nit geven gegangen oyf der f⟨UNK⟩ fabrike,

00:03:42.117 --> 00:03:44.250
volt ikh geven gekent efsher zikh UNK zayn a,

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.850
a VRACH, efsher volt ikh geven geven a UCHITEL'NITSA,

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:48.335
efsher volt ikh geven geven,

00:03:48.335 --> 00:03:51.280
 vos kh'hob geshri- gezesn in a kantor un shraybn.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:55.226
un azoy hob ikh nit gehat keyn VOZMOZHNOST', hob ikh gemuzt geyn in shkole.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.144
ikh bin gegangen in ⟨park-⟩shkole,

00:03:57.144 --> 00:04:01.692
un fleg men mir oykh gebn POMOSHCH'. me fleg mir gebn azoyne shtivl, fleg ikh onton oyf di fis.

00:04:01.692 --> 00:04:04.690
me fleg mir gebn POMOSHCH'. m'hot gevust az ikh hob a oreme mame

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:07.200
un der tate iz nishto, oyf der milkhome farfaln gevorn.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:11.041
fleg men mir gebn POMOSHCH'. me fleg helfn. di melukhe fleg helfn.

00:04:11.041 --> 00:04:15.544
me fleg mir gebn a palto, me fleg mir gebn a por tshobetes, abi ikh zol geyn in shkole zikh lernen.

00:04:16.613 --> 00:04:19.003
VAM, ETO SHKOLA POMOGALA...?

00:04:16.638 --> 00:04:18.030
VSЁ.

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:22.934
yo, yo, di shkole fleg mir helfn. di ⟨park-⟩shkole fleg mir helfn UNK.

00:04:21.827 --> 00:04:23.795
A VY POMNITE SVOYU SHKOLU?

00:04:23.667 --> 00:04:24.774
avade.

00:04:24.274 --> 00:04:28.390
VY MOZHETE O NEY RASSKAZAT' I, UNK, VMESTE S ETIM,

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:34.025
 S RASSKAZOM O SHKOLE, RASSKAZAT' O EVREYSKIKH DETYAKH, KOTORYE TAM UCHILIS', ESLI ONI UCHILIS' S VAMI?

00:04:34.025 --> 00:04:35.338
VY POMNITE...

00:04:34.078 --> 00:04:37.923
nu, di EVREYSK⟨UNK⟩ kinder, veys ikh nit,

00:04:37.923 --> 00:04:41.087
un ikh ken shoyn nit di ukraynske⟨UNK⟩ kinder oykh nit.

00:04:41.087 --> 00:04:45.998
nor ikh, VSPOMINAe, ikh bin gegangen in shkole ⟨park-⟩shkole, geven a direktor

00:04:45.998 --> 00:04:47.758
bay undz GAVRUSHENKO.

00:04:47.865 --> 00:04:51.490
iz GAVRUSHENKO, iz er shoyn geshtorbn. iz er geven a goy.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:55.280
nor er hot ⟨mir,⟩ gekent mayn ZHIZN', hot er mir gehelfn.

00:04:55.280 --> 00:04:59.310
hot er gezogt, "shraybt oys, Brukhen, Feldman

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:05.620
a por shtivl." fleg men mir oysshraybn a por shtivl. "shrayb ir oys a KURTOCHKe." a KURTOCHKe tsi a KOFTOCHKe. me fleg mir gebn, ⟨ikh fleg im on-⟩...

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.926
ikh fleg esn BESPLATNe oykhet dortn.

00:05:07.926 --> 00:05:11.698
me fleg azoyne kinder gebn esn oykhet. iz dos UNK geven in ⟨park-⟩shkole.

00:05:11.698 --> 00:05:13.681
nu, az ikh hob gekontshet di ⟨park-⟩shkole,

00:05:13.681 --> 00:05:15.838
bin ikh ibergegangen in BALABAYSKe shkole.

00:05:16.333 --> 00:05:18.402
dortn hob ikh shoyn gekontshet di kursn.

00:05:18.932 --> 00:05:20.512
akht klasn, I VSЁ.

00:05:20.552 --> 00:05:25.552
 gedenk ikh BALABAY, ⟨un,⟩ BALABAY hot zikh UNK er fleg undz gebn historye fleg er undz gebn.

00:05:25.552 --> 00:05:28.106
nor f- nokh der arbet fleg ikh geyn in shkole.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:30.497
 BRUNYA, SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA,

00:05:30.497 --> 00:05:33.826
A SREDI UCHITELEY, KOTORYE VAS UCHILI, BYLI EVREI?

00:05:34.035 --> 00:05:34.906
neyn.

00:05:35.436 --> 00:05:40.352
neyn, y- ah! s'iz UNK s'iz geven eyner, yo. geven, NEMETSKe hot er gegebn.

00:05:35.706 --> 00:05:36.876
UNK ⟨ILI⟩

00:05:36.876 --> 00:05:38.096
⟨V ETOY SHK-...⟩

00:05:40.352 --> 00:05:41.685
er iz geshtorbn.

00:05:41.685 --> 00:05:43.462
MALEN'KIY TAKOY BYL.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:51.225
er iz geven, iz er geshtorbn., zayn zun, tsi zayn tokhter iz a DETSKIY VRACH. zi vil itster avekforn in Amerike.

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:53.418
 NATAN ANDREEVICH?

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:52.574
UNK

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:53.860
DA, DA.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:57.620
iz er fleg undz gebn NEMETSKe⟨, o.⟩

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:03.594
un dernokh dem iz geven, nokhet eyne fleg gebn NEMETSKe, ⟨iz zi⟩ oykh geven a yidishke UCHITEL'Ke, ⟨Lipe tsop⟩,

00:06:03.685 --> 00:06:05.670
 hot men zi gerufn.

00:06:05.878 --> 00:06:09.787
 LYUBA, vos iz itster a ⟨MILOSERDIe⟩, ir TЁTYA.

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:11.593
a, Lipman RIVA L'VOVNA.

00:06:10.435 --> 00:06:15.390
Lipman L'VOV⟨NA⟩. TOZHE⟨, ⟨iz zi⟩ oykh geven mayn UCHITEL'NITSe. NEMETSKe hot zi gegebn.

00:06:15.109 --> 00:06:16.605
 BRUNYA...

00:06:15.497 --> 00:06:17.414
nor veynik yidn iz geven.

00:06:17.202 --> 00:06:21.341
BRUNYA, RIVA L'VOVNA Lipman BYLA VASHA UCHITEL'NITSA. ONA,

00:06:20.121 --> 00:06:22.055
UCHITEL'NITSA PO NEMETSK⟨e⟩.

00:06:21.341 --> 00:06:25.042
ONA TOZHE BYLA ⟨VO⟩ VREMYA VOYNY V GETTO.

00:06:23.462 --> 00:06:26.443
yo, yo, zi iz oykh geven in geto UNK.

00:06:25.386 --> 00:06:31.240
ONA KOGDA-TO ⟨V, NI-⟩ KOGDA-NIBUD', GOVORILA VAM OB ETOM V SHKOLE?

00:06:30.482 --> 00:06:34.036
NE, NE. ONA NAM V SHKOLE hot zi nit gezogt.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:32.316
NIKOGDA?

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:38.137
z- nu, zi iz geven in shkole... zi iz geven a bisl tsedreyt.

00:06:38.346 --> 00:06:42.550
 ale kinder flegn lakhn fun ir. az zi fleg araynkumen in klas arayn, fleg men lakhn.

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:44.932
"⟨SYDY TYKHO, YA VAM NAPYSHU P'YAT'⟩!"

00:06:44.932 --> 00:06:47.755
fleg zi zogn. "ikh'l aykh shteln finef, abi ir zitst shtil!"

00:06:47.863 --> 00:06:50.354
NU, ONA SEBYA BYLA TAKAYA UCHITEL'NITSA.

00:06:50.614 --> 00:06:55.890
nu, un, un ⟨z-⟩ s'iz geven nokh a UCHITEL', iz er geshtorbn,

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:59.150
 PO ISTORI⟨e⟩, a yid,

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:02.140
Ketsma-, di familye Ketsman, PO-MOEMU.

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:02.438
Kertsman.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:06.200
DA. iz er oykh geshtorbn. oykh geven a guter yid a UCHITEL'.

00:07:06.223 --> 00:07:08.984
er hot undz oykh gelernt, hot mikh oykh gelernt.

00:07:09.345 --> 00:07:12.967
VSЁ. vayter yidn ⟨zenen⟩ geven veynik. goyim zenen geven I VSЁ.

00:07:13.547 --> 00:07:17.200
nu, zey hobn zikh oykh gegebn goyishe urokn.

00:07:17.479 --> 00:07:20.100
s'iz dokh dem⟨UNK⟩t nit geven vos m'hot gelernt yidish.

00:07:18.424 --> 00:07:19.810
⟨yo, yo.⟩

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:23.508
yidish iz, hot men gelernt, iz geven a shkole oto do o lebn stadyon

00:07:23.508 --> 00:07:25.100
iz geven di yidishe shkole.

00:07:25.225 --> 00:07:28.104
gedenk ikh zi oykhet, az s'iz geven dortn a yidishe shkole.

00:07:27.182 --> 00:07:32.491
A CHTO VY ZNAETE PRO T- O, O TOY EVREYSKOY SHKOLE, KOTORAYA BYLA ⟨OKOLO⟩ STADIONA? CHTO VY O NEY ZNAETE?

00:07:30.996 --> 00:07:34.519
NU, VO VREMYA VOYNY m'iz gegangen zikh lernen dortn.

00:07:34.506 --> 00:07:35.900
DO VOYNY, ⟨A⟩?

00:07:34.519 --> 00:07:35.400
iz mayn sh-...

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:41.435
 yo, iz mayn shvester hot zikh dortn gelernt, un ikh, vi hob ikh shoyn gekent lernen zikh? nor s'iz geven a yidishe shkole.

00:07:36.836 --> 00:07:37.836
UNK

00:07:42.117 --> 00:07:45.927
di mame hot mir dertseylt un mentshn hobn dertseylt az s'iz a yidishe shkole.

00:07:45.927 --> 00:07:50.632
un biz ater veys ikh az s'iz geven a yidishe shkole. nu, itster iz dortn shoyn, a ander shkole.

00:07:55.161 --> 00:07:57.520
YASNO. BRUNYA, SKAZHITE, POZHALUYSTA,

00:07:57.520 --> 00:08:05.055
 VOT VY, VYROSLI V BERSHADI. VY ZNALI O TOM, CHTO VOKRUG BERSHADI OCHEN' MNOGO MALEN'KIKH MESTECHEK,

00:08:05.055 --> 00:08:07.063
OBODOVKA, ⟨UNK⟩GOPOL',

00:08:07.063 --> 00:08:08.900
GDE TOZHE ZHILI EVREI,

00:08:08.726 --> 00:08:09.726
Z- Z-...

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:12.839
DOPUSTIM, TAM KOGDA-TO ZHILO OCHEN' MNOGO EVREEV TAM? UNK

00:08:11.715 --> 00:08:15.340
nu, ikh veys, in Obodovke iz gezesn oykhet yidn,

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:18.158
nor di yidn zenen oykh avekgeforn in IZRAILe.

00:08:18.158 --> 00:08:19.570
ikh veys dortn

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:23.032
⟨a-⟩ vi azoy veys ikh? vayl mayne kinder hobn zikh gelernt dortn in Obodovke,

00:08:23.224 --> 00:08:24.394
in internat.

00:08:24.394 --> 00:08:30.170
iz fleg ikh kumen tsu forn, flegn mikh di yidishkes der⟨k-⟩ -zen, flegn zey zogn, "o, du bist a yidishke?" zog ikh, "yo.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.493
ir zent oykh a yidishke?" ⟨zi iz⟩ oykh a yidishke.

00:08:32.493 --> 00:08:37.764
iz zey hobn gevoynt un zenen zey avekgeforn; in Obodovke voynen itster dortn nit keyn yidn nishto, keyner nit.

00:08:38.192 --> 00:08:39.637
dortn nishto keyn yidn.

00:08:39.964 --> 00:08:42.101
m'iz oykh avekgeforn in IZRAILe.

00:08:42.275 --> 00:08:44.090
tsvey yidn ⟨bloyz⟩.

00:08:43.018 --> 00:08:44.109
yo.

00:08:45.128 --> 00:08:51.484
NO VY, A VASHI DETI, CHTO, VOSPITYVALIS' V INTERNATE ⟨K- KAKOE-TO VREMYA⟩?

00:08:49.347 --> 00:08:53.309
nu, az ikh hob gearbet oyf der MEBEL'Ne fabrike un ikh bin geven eyne aleyn,

00:08:53.309 --> 00:08:54.926
un s'iz mir geven shver,

00:08:54.949 --> 00:09:00.810
iz, hot men mir OFORMet, un zey hobn zikh gelernt. hot zi gekontshet dortn tsen klasn, un di hot gekontshet tsen klasn.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:06.606
nor ikh hob zikh nit OTKAZYVAet fun zey; ikh bin geforn tsu zey, ikh fleg zey brengen un aldings. dos iz geven mayne kinder.

00:09:06.606 --> 00:09:09.652
un zey flegn kumen tsu mir un aldings, nor ikh hob nit gehat

00:09:09.652 --> 00:09:15.294
B⟨UNK⟩T zey tsu gebn azoy fil ontsuton un aldings. m'iz ⟨dokh⟩ dem⟨UNK⟩t oykh gegangen ongeton azoy.

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:22.905
nu, un dernokh dem hob ikh zey opgenemen, nor, zey hobn zikh gelernt gut. di hot gekontshet tsen klasn, un di hot gekontshet tsen klasn.

00:09:23.333 --> 00:09:27.152
un di UCHITEL'NITSes hobn UVAZHAet zey, un m'hot mikh UVAZHAet.

00:09:27.152 --> 00:09:30.499
ikh fleg kumen un tsum direktor fleg ikh redn un aldings.

00:09:31.753 --> 00:09:34.497
ONI OKONCHILI DESYAT' KLASSOV V SHKOLE-INTERNATE?

00:09:33.981 --> 00:09:36.590
DA. DA. OBE. DA.

00:09:34.639 --> 00:09:36.607
OBE, OBE DOCHERI, DA?

00:09:36.748 --> 00:09:41.838
NO ONI ZNALI, CHTO, "MAMA, TEBE OCHEN' TYAZHELO," azoy me zogt, ⟨s'iz mir, "s'iz dir⟩ shtark shver,

00:09:41.895 --> 00:09:45.081
I mir'n dir nit UPREKAen NIKOGDA in ZHIZN' nit."

00:09:45.081 --> 00:09:48.450
un itster, zey veysn, hobn gekontshet tsen klasn. nu, iz vos zhe?

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:53.550
VSЁ. ikh bin ⟨fo-⟩ geforn tsu zey, ikh hob zey gebrakht un aldings. kh'hob gearbet oyf der MEBEL'Ne. kh'fleg fardinen...

00:09:53.573 --> 00:09:56.182
vos fleg ikh dem⟨olts⟩ fardinen? zibetsik ⟨erlekh⟩,

00:09:56.205 --> 00:10:02.949
UNK zekhtsik ⟨erlekh⟩? kh'hob gekent onton tsvey kinder? kh'hob gekent gebn tsvey kinder? azoy hobn zey zikh oysgelernt, VSЁ. di gosudarstv⟨ene⟩ hot mir geholfn.

00:10:02.955 --> 00:10:06.492
un biz, on eyn kopeke. kh'hob afile gornit getsolt.

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:10.284
abi zogn, s'iz gegangen, di Ukraine iz mir gegangen NAVSTRECHe.

00:10:10.284 --> 00:10:13.547
itster iz zi Ukraine; dem⟨olts⟩ iz geven SOVETSKAYA VLAST'.

00:10:14.481 --> 00:10:17.110
I VSЁ. vos zhe ken ikh zikh OBIZHAen?

00:10:16.817 --> 00:10:18.530
UNK

00:10:17.451 --> 00:10:21.160
un oyf der arbet iz, NA KAZHDOM SHAGU iz men gegangen NAVSTRECHe. ⟨nu⟩,

00:10:19.678 --> 00:10:21.258
SHLI NAVSTRECHU, ⟨DA⟩.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:23.202
dernokh dem zenen zey gekumen aheym oyf kanikule,

00:10:23.202 --> 00:10:29.595
hot men mikh gefregt, "PIONERSKIY lager forn kinder?" tsvey mol. un m'hot GRAMOTes hobn zey gehat.

00:10:29.685 --> 00:10:32.733
un, m'hot mikh geKHVALet vos ikh hob azoyne tsvey kinder.

00:10:32.773 --> 00:10:35.267
un FOTOGRAFII hot men zey SNIMAet.

00:10:35.267 --> 00:10:39.196
un, "CHTO VY ⟨VYKHOVALI⟩ TAKIE DVOE DETEY," hot men mir gezogt.

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:42.710
VSЁ. TAKAYA ZHIZN'.

00:10:43.303 --> 00:10:47.460
A SKOL'KO IM BYLO LET, KOGDA VY VYNUZHDENY BYLI IKH UNK...?

00:10:46.476 --> 00:10:47.988
PERVYY KLASS.

00:10:47.522 --> 00:10:49.170
V INTERNAT UNK?

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:51.914
PERVYY KLASS. KOGDA ikh hob SDAet di eltere tokhter,

00:10:51.914 --> 00:10:56.328
iz zi antlofn fun dortn. zi hot nit gevolt zayn. dernokh hot zi zikh umgekert un zi iz shoyn geven.

00:10:56.328 --> 00:10:59.784
un di klenere iz DAZHE nit antlofn gornit. funem ershtn klas.

00:10:59.908 --> 00:11:01.944
hobn zey gekontshet biz tsen klasn.

00:11:02.001 --> 00:11:09.448
un zey zenen aroysgegangen gramotne un aldings. dernokh dem, az zey hobn gekontshet dortn, m'hot zey gegebn di DOKUMENTn, bin ikh shoyn geforn in Vinitse mit der elterer...

00:11:09.448 --> 00:11:10.955
mir hot shoyn gekost...

00:11:10.978 --> 00:11:16.574
un zi iz geven in a OBSHCHEZHITIe. zi hot zikh gelernt a ⟨PRESHIROKe⟩ PROFIL', PARIKMAKHER.

00:11:16.547 --> 00:11:17.638
ETO

00:11:16.648 --> 00:11:19.050
I DAMSKIY I MUZHSKOY ken zi.

00:11:17.998 --> 00:11:19.308
V UCHILISHCHE, DA?

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:20.354
yo, V UCHILISHCHE.

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:26.429
⟨A V-⟩ ETO UZHE VAM PRIKHODILOS' SAM⟨OY⟩ EЁ PODDERZHAT', UCHIT' EЁ?

00:11:22.335 --> 00:11:23.409
⟨tsvey...⟩

00:11:24.192 --> 00:11:28.576
YA SAMA, yo, aldings. ikh aleyn, ikh aleyn. i di, i di.

00:11:28.576 --> 00:11:31.706
un di, di klenere, hot zikh gelernt in Stri bay mayn shvester,

00:11:31.706 --> 00:11:33.166
V OTDEL KADR⟨е⟩...

00:11:33.166 --> 00:11:38.242
 NU, NE V OTDEL KADR⟨e⟩. OTDEL KADR⟨e⟩ PO STEKLOM, STEKLOZAVOD.

00:11:36.974 --> 00:11:37.974
⟨.⟩

00:11:38.316 --> 00:11:44.435
ZNACHIT, BUTYLKI, az di BUTYLKI zenen tsebrokhn, zi geyt arum mitn fingerl un ⟨pruvt, a... BRAKOVSHCHIKOM⟩.

00:11:44.712 --> 00:11:46.540
⟨zi hot gearbet dort?⟩

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:46.342
yo.

00:11:47.108 --> 00:11:49.161
I KAK DOLGO ONA TAM BYLA?

00:11:48.593 --> 00:11:51.050
in, V Ades? UNK

00:11:49.858 --> 00:11:50.982
V STRYYU.

00:11:51.175 --> 00:11:52.704
GOD UCHILAS'.

00:11:52.187 --> 00:11:53.430
GOD.

00:11:52.812 --> 00:11:54.966
DA. I MAYA, TAK I ONA.

00:11:56.153 --> 00:12:02.728
A TEPER' ONA RABOTAET NA STEKОL'NOM zavod, un s'iz nishto keyn arbet, arbet zi nit dem dritn khoydesh UNK arbet zi shoyn nit.

00:12:02.565 --> 00:12:04.280
ONA SYUDA PRIEZZHAET K VAM?

00:12:04.438 --> 00:12:06.474
KAZHDYY OTPUSK,

00:12:06.615 --> 00:12:09.849
MESYATS. OTPUSK ONA PRIEZZHAET mitn kind,

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:12.830
est bay mir, trinkt bay mir, vos s'iz do.

00:12:12.538 --> 00:12:14.740
NU, UNK KAK DOCHKA.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.996
in eynem KONE- KAK MAMA.

00:12:14.740 --> 00:12:15.610
⟨KAK MAMA.⟩

00:12:17.263 --> 00:12:20.952
VAM, PENSIYA VASHA SEYCHAS KHVATAET NA ZHIZN'?

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:26.707
KHVATAET, NE KHVATAET, ESLI BY ONI DALI, NORMAL'NO, TAK KHVATILI B!

00:12:26.511 --> 00:12:28.300
REGULYARNO UNK?

00:12:26.815 --> 00:12:29.509
ven UNK KONECHNO, ven me git yeder khoydesh.

00:12:29.616 --> 00:12:31.882
az ikh hob POLUCHet, dem khoydesh

00:12:31.882 --> 00:12:33.603
finef un zekhtsik ⟨erlekh⟩,

00:12:33.603 --> 00:12:37.271
hob ikh genemen, draysik ⟨erlekh⟩, aroysgeshikt dem kind...

00:12:37.345 --> 00:12:40.725
ikh darf dokh zi PODDERZHIVen... un s'iberike iz mir ibergeblibn.

00:12:40.725 --> 00:12:44.710
se KHVATAet yo, s'KHVATAet nit, nor ven me git zi REGULYARNO iz,...

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:47.835
danken got, oyf broyt iz do. hungerik bin ikh nit.

00:12:47.858 --> 00:12:52.239
oyf broyt, a mol a shtikele fleysh, a mol, dos, a mol yents. ikh bin nit hungerik!

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:57.070
un naket gey ikh oykh nit, kholile. VSЁ.

00:12:58.405 --> 00:13:03.951
TAK SKAZAT', ZHIZNENNYY MINIMUM VSЁ-TAKI VY IMEETE? KVARTIRA I UNK...

00:13:02.185 --> 00:13:07.387
NU, K- avade. kh'hob itster a kvartire. ikh leb itster. NE TO, CHTO...

00:13:07.387 --> 00:13:08.861
ikh leb itster.

00:13:09.306 --> 00:13:12.860
friert hob ikh ge⟨nudy⟩et. ikh hob g-... itster leb ikh.

00:13:13.153 --> 00:13:16.167
I VSЁ. ⟨n-⟩ nem un tsebrekh zikh un for in IZRAIL'.

00:13:16.714 --> 00:13:21.635
NU, VY MO- SAMI MOZHETE SEBE VYBRAT' RESHENIE ⟨EKHAT', ⟩...

00:13:20.022 --> 00:13:24.049
ikh veys, ⟨nor⟩ VSЁ, ⟨n-,⟩ dos kind hot k- shtark nit keyn akhote.

00:13:24.223 --> 00:13:25.736
NU, KAK DETI...

00:13:24.628 --> 00:13:30.666
zi zogt az zi shteyt in k-, in otshered oyf a kvartire in Ades. ikh veys ven m'vet gebn in Ades di kvartire.

00:13:30.666 --> 00:13:33.566
zi voynt ⟨zi⟩kh in a OBSHCHEZHITIe, eyn KOMNATe, a SEMEYNe.

00:13:34.472 --> 00:13:35.870
⟨⟩.

00:13:34.888 --> 00:13:38.426
un, nit UDACHNe, veyst, di hot UDACHNe khasene gehat.

00:13:38.668 --> 00:13:42.644
un, ye- di hot nit UDACHNe khasene gehat I VSЁ. a shiker I VSЁ.

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:45.676
vos zhe ken ikh makhn? iz zi, ober zi hot zikh a sheyn kind.

00:13:45.676 --> 00:13:48.760
zi darf zikh lebn ts⟨UNK⟩ kind. vos hob ikh geton mit tsvey kinder?

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.960
kh'hob zikh nit avekgegebn keynem zey nit.

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:56.440
VSЁ PRAVIL'NO. VSЁ PRAVIL'NO, BRUNYA.

00:13:57.028 --> 00:14:03.320
BRUNYA, PONIMAETE, DELO V TOM, CHTO MY S VAMI VSTRETILIS' DLYA TOGO, CHTOBY VY RASSKAZALI O SVOEY ZHIZNI,

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:07.656
POSKOL'KU VOYNA KOSNULAS' VAS, REBЁNKOM, NO KOSNULAS'.

00:14:05.787 --> 00:14:08.393
DA. DA.

00:14:07.656 --> 00:14:12.920
 ZDES' TAKAYA SITUATSIYA S SEGODNYASHNEY NASHEY VSTRECHEY, CHTO

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:16.380
VIDEOKASSETA, KOTORAYA ZAPISYVAET NASHU BESEDU,

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.052
DA.

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:21.480
ONA BUDET KHRANITSYA OCHEN' DOLGO V, V AMERIKE, V LOS-ANDZHELESE,

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:28.674
 UNK, POD, UNK PRISMOTROM STIVENA SPILBERGA, POD EGO UNK....

00:14:22.378 --> 00:14:23.378
UNK

00:14:26.256 --> 00:14:29.051
nu, loz er SOKHRANY- loz er SOKHRANYAen.

00:14:28.674 --> 00:14:31.768
DA, I KOGDA-NIBUD' PRIDЁT,

00:14:29.867 --> 00:14:32.460
ikh ho- ikh hob nit keyn PROTIV.

00:14:32.061 --> 00:14:40.730
PROYDЁT MNOGO VREMENI I MOZHET BYT' KAKOY-TO UCHЁNYY ILI ISTORIK ILI SLEDOVATEL' ZAKHOCHET, UVIDET' LYUBUYU KASSETU I POPADЁT NA VASHU,

00:14:40.583 --> 00:14:41.555
nu?

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:46.544
I UNK SMOZHET, VIDET' N-, PROSLUSHAT', PROSMOTRET' NASH S VAMI RAZGOVOR.

00:14:46.544 --> 00:14:51.220
VY, KONECHNO PROZHILI SVOYU ZHIZN' TAK KAK VY EЁ PROZHILI, NO CHTO BY VY

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:56.855
MOGLI SKAZAT' VOT LYUDYAM, KOTORYE KOGDA-NIBUD' CHEREZ DVADTSAT', TRIDTSAT', SOROK LET, MOZHET BYT' BOL'SHE,

00:14:56.855 --> 00:15:00.610
 SLUCHAYNO, MOZHET BYT' DAZHE, POPADUT NA ETU KASSETU

00:15:00.343 --> 00:15:01.299
nu?

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:02.250
I PROSMOTRYAT EЁ?

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:02.919
nu?

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:06.109
