00:15:04.242 --> 00:15:05.079
nu?

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:12.700
SP- nu, i- ikh volt zey gezogt, SPASIBO vos ir hert mayn GOLOS,

00:15:06.958 --> 00:15:08.403
VOT KAK EVREYKA.

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:15.047
