00:15:15.047 --> 00:15:16.976
ikh bin aykh OCHEN' BLAGODARNA.

00:15:17.995 --> 00:15:20.250
CHTO ZHE, vos zhe ken ikh nokh zogn zey?

00:15:20.948 --> 00:15:22.866
