00:15:23.682 --> 00:15:25.279
TEM, CHTO BYLO, DA?

00:15:24.188 --> 00:15:25.973
DA, CHTOBY ETIM, DA.

00:15:25.973 --> 00:15:27.550
vos zhe ken ikh nokh zogn?

00:15:29.689 --> 00:15:40.753
BRUNYA, SPASIBO VAM BOL'SHOE ZA TO VNIMANIE, KOTOROE VY NAM UDELILI. SPASIBO CHTO VY PRISHLI K NAM I SPAS- DAVAYTE POBLAGODARIM STIVENA SPILBERGA, CHTO ON DAL NAM VOZMOZHNOST' OBSHCHAT'SYA, POTOMU CHTO MNOGO OBSHCHAEMSYA UNK...

